# Copy to ~/.config/afa/peers. One line per other machine: its machine name, then a ssh target that reaches
# its home folder without a password (key login). fleet-up.sh reads <home>/.claude/state/heartbeat there and puts
# one inbox line when the other machine goes silent for 10 minutes or comes back. No file, no check.
#OTHER-MACHINE	user@192.0.2.10
